  data: {
    LLM: "Keep a variety of numbers in your hand to ensure you can play on either end of the layout. Don't play your last card of a specific number too early.\n\nBlocking strategy: If you have many 4s, try to make both ends of the layout 4. This 'blocks' the board for everyone except you.\n\nCard Counting (Tile Tracking): Since you know which tiles are out of the game (the 4 set aside), you can eventually deduce exactly what your opponent holds.",
    Player: "Keep a variety of numbers in your hand to ensure you can play on either end of the layout. Don't play your last card of a specific number too early.\n\nBlocking strategy: If you have many 4s, try to make both ends of the layout 4. This 'blocks' the board for everyone except you.\n\nCard Counting (Tile Tracking): Since you know which tiles are out of the game (the 4 set aside), you can eventually deduce exactly what your opponent holds.",
